+- [x] Add deterministic predicate cases around `2026-10-23T00:00:00Z` with due date `2026-10-22`: true at midnight, false one tick before; test a non-UTC offset representing that same instant. Include an empty filter result.
+- [x] Run `dotnet test --filter FullyQualifiedName~TodoStoreTests`; verify failure is due to the missing interfaces/behavior.
+- [x] Implement the interfaces in `TodoStore.cs`. `IsOverdue` delegates to `IsOverdueAt(DateTimeOffset.UtcNow)`; the latter compares with `DateOnly.FromDateTime(instant.UtcDateTime)`. Apply dates under the existing lock; filter without changing ID ordering. Annotate the PATCH presence flag with `JsonIgnore`.
+- [x] Run the store tests; expect all to pass. Existing exact JSON API assertions will be updated in Task 2 for the approved new response fields.
